Z||000029||Songman||06-03-2001||12:48 PM||||Check the pics of the fastbacks that AusFiero did a while back. Why not go ahead and incorporate the little built in flipped up tail onto this car to make it totally smooth. It looked great in his pictures. Should'nt be all that hard either...<P>I was talking about this yesterday with Keith when he was over here and I am not even sure it could be done. But it would look pretty cool if you could somehow snake your exhaust around and have it come out right behind each door. I saw that on a Chrysler product in the Hot Rod magazine that Phil's car was in. Looked dang good, but might be a nightmare in a mid engine car. Would really be cool since you already filled in your rear exhaust outlets anyway.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
